      "message": "i\u0027m on a drive for what I consider simplifying logic.\nhow about:\n\nif (mthd) return true\nif (xmf) return true\n... the rtl and ota and imelody checks ...\nif (OURNEWFLAG) { MidiEngine p(); if (p.initCheck() \u003d\u003d ok) return true; }\n\nreturn false\n\nand the sense of OURNEWFLAG becomes more \"are we keeping the old way as a fallback\".\nthan an either/or decision.",
